iolations against children that have increased dramtically over the past year, according to a new report by Save the Children.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea expanded uranium enrichment plant, says IAEA head</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b6843ee026f02e5266b6270f1386bdf980a92f2f08a46eb6a5204a5a121544af</id><updated>2026-11-19T07:40:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T15:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-expanded-uranium-enrichment-plant-says-iaea-head/a-79982758--65619f1023d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-expanded-uranium-enrichment-plant-says-iaea-head/a-79982758?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">IAEA chief Rafael Grossi has said the ongoing expansion of North Korea's uranium enrichment program remains "a cause for serious concern."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: Online censorship grows after 'Cockroach' protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f527c9114dcf8efd0e17cb9601930a447087f5fdd655c6dedc7f67c0c39d3a23</id><updated>2026-11-19T07:40:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T14:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-online-censorship-grows-after-cockroach-protests/a-79976982--a74d2015326f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-online-censorship-grows-after-cockroach-protests/a-79976982?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Since anti-government Cockroach protests erupted, journalists and creators say their content is increasingly being restricted on social media in India.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>ICJ to rule on Rohingya genocide case against Myanmar: What to know</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0879868e2928a24ca96cf28095928fb5828ebdcc531c5111c18f872b91f09dc0</id><updated>2026-11-19T07:40:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T14:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/icj-to-rule-on-rohingya-genocide-case-against-myanmar-what-to-know/a-79981434--76de3c2375bc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/icj-to-rule-on-rohingya-genocide-case-against-myanmar-what-to-know/a-79981434?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The ICJ is set to decide whether Myanmar's military operations in Rakhine State a decade ago were carried out with the intent to destroy the country's Rohingya minority, in whole or in part.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Axes and cutlasses: Violence on Nigeria's election campaign trail</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e578965c6a08b4d0f2e8d29938adad720a7a02bff3d0e1bd0b5cca25c76aba7f</id><updated>2026-11-19T07:40:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T10:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/axes-and-cutlasses-violence-on-nigeria-s-election-campaign-trail/a-79978467--351fdc554734.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/axes-and-cutlasses-violence-on-nigeria-s-election-campaign-trail/a-79978467?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Nigeria's January 2027 elections approach, political violence and thuggery at campaign rallies and town hall meetings raise concerns about voter safety.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Latin America's mega-prisons: Can El Salvador's model work?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3d3f59f1928bb63e70a5bc9d6990f5e9dd5741a363040e05519f3c45a28aa244</id><updated>2026-11-19T07:40:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T10:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/latin-america-s-mega-prisons-can-el-salvador-s-model-work/a-79973524--e4fa38fb46de.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/latin-america-s-mega-prisons-can-el-salvador-s-model-work/a-79973524?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">El Salvador's mega-prison has b